sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant LoginScreen
    participant AuthRepository
    participant FirebaseAuth
    participant Firestore as Firestore (users)
    participant NextScreen as Onboarding / Home

    User->>LoginScreen: enter username + password, tap "Login"
    LoginScreen->>AuthRepository: loginWithUsername(username, password)
    AuthRepository->>Firestore: query users where username == username (limit 1)
    Firestore-->>AuthRepository: user doc { email }
    AuthRepository->>FirebaseAuth: signInWithEmailAndPassword(email, password)
    FirebaseAuth-->>AuthRepository: UserCredential
    AuthRepository->>FirebaseAuth: getIdToken()
    AuthRepository->>Firestore: get users/{uid}
    Firestore-->>AuthRepository: UserModel { isFirstTime, ... }

    alt isFirstTime == true
        AuthRepository-->>LoginScreen: profile (isFirstTime = true)
        LoginScreen->>NextScreen: pushAndRemoveUntil(OnboardingScreen)
    else returning user
        AuthRepository-->>LoginScreen: profile (isFirstTime = false)
        LoginScreen->>NextScreen: pushAndRemoveUntil(HomeScreen)
    end

    rect rgb(247,247,247)
    Note over User,FirebaseAuth: Alt path - Google Sign-In
    User->>LoginScreen: tap "Sign in with Google"
    LoginScreen->>AuthRepository: signInWithGoogle()
    AuthRepository->>FirebaseAuth: signInWithCredential(GoogleAuthProvider)
    FirebaseAuth-->>AuthRepository: UserCredential
    opt users/{uid} does not exist
        AuthRepository->>Firestore: batch create users/{uid} + profile/preferences
        Note right of Firestore: publicKey=null, isAdmin=false,<br/>isFirstTime=true, biometricGateEnabled=false
    end
    AuthRepository-->>LoginScreen: profile (isFirstTime branch as above)
    end

    alt FirebaseAuthException
        FirebaseAuth-->>LoginScreen: error code (user-not-found / wrong-password /<br/>invalid-credential / too-many-requests / user-disabled)
        LoginScreen-->>User: inline error message
    end
